<title>POLAND: Mostostal-Z sees '97 net up to PLN 11 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-Z sees '97 net up to PLN 11 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Mostostal Zabrze SA expects to lift its 1997 net profit to 11 million zlotys from nine million last year, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Mostostal said its group net profit was likely to rise to 15 million zlotys this year from 11 million zlotys in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
